Subject: [PATCH] Exclude Prophide from r9s's retained legacy charger-property reader

Subtract ONLY the new helper from the already narrowed r9s compatibility
reader. All original domains, mapping members and assertions stay intact.

diff --git a/plat_pub_versioned.cil b/plat_pub_versioned.cil
--- a/plat_pub_versioned.cil
+++ b/plat_pub_versioned.cil
@@ -6411,7 +6411,9 @@
 (allow domain exported_radio_prop_30_0 (file (read getattr map open)))
 (allow domain exported_secure_prop_30_0 (file (read getattr map open)))
 ; One UI 9 contract: restrict legacy grant
-(allow unica_api30_r9s_charger_readers exported_system_prop_30_0 (file (read open)))
+(typeattribute unica_prophide_api30_property_reader)
+(typeattributeset unica_prophide_api30_property_reader (and unica_api30_r9s_charger_readers (not (prophide_stage))))
+(allow unica_prophide_api30_property_reader exported_system_prop_30_0 (file (read open)))
 (allow unica_api30_r9s_charger_legacy_sources unica_api30_public_grant_43 (file (read open)))
 (allow unica_api30_public_grant_42 unica_api30_public_grant_43 (file (read open)))
 (allow domain exported_system_prop_30_0 (file (getattr map)))
